[TR][TD][B]Multi-server / proxy[/B] (Velocity)[/TD][TD]✅ proxy-direct[/TD][TD][I]proxy-direct[/I] transport ships in the free build: cross-server [I]/rtp[/I] over a lightweight TCP socket, no Redis/SQL.[/TD][/TR]
