[I]Built-in [I]/rtp[/I] visualizations: live MSPT / heap graphs while a scan runs (left), and a land-vs-water heatmap of the region (right), the same diagnostics behind the numbers above.[/I][/CENTER]
[/SPOILER]


[SPOILER='Commands & permissions reference']
[B]Commands[/B] (registered aliases: [I]/rtp[/I], [I]/wild[/I]):
[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Command[/TH]
[TH]Description[/TH]
[TH]Permission[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp[/I] / [I]/wild[/I][/TD]
[TD]Random teleport to the default region for your current world[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.use[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp region:<name>[/I][/TD]
[TD]Teleport to a named region[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.region[/I] / [I]rtp.regions.*[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp world:<world>[/I][/TD]
[TD]Teleport within a specific world[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.world[/I] / [I]rtp.worlds.*[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp player:<name>[/I][/TD]
[TD]Teleport another player[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.other[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp biome:<biome>[/I][/TD]
[TD]Teleport to a chosen biome[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.biome[/I] / [I]rtp.biome.*[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp centerx=<x> centerz=<z> radius=<r>[/I][/TD]
[TD]Ephemeral per-call overrides[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.params[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp menu[/I][/TD]
[TD]Interactive book (Paper) or chat-paginated menu[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.use[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp reload [file][/I][/TD]
[TD]Reload all configuration, or one file[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.reload[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp config <file> view|set <k>=<v>[/I][/TD]
[TD]View or set a config key, then auto-reload[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.config[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp scan start|pause|resume|reset|cancel[/I][/TD]
[TD]Background spatial-memory crawl[/TD]
